  <item>
    <title>ep15.看电影而已，怎么吵成这样？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63dcff87e99bdef7d3f65544</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63dcff87e99bdef7d3f65544</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 03 Feb 2023 12:35:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好累，不多说了，上时间轴。本期嘉宾路老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="57">00:00:57</a> 这个春节档，大家吵了些什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="127">00:02:07</a> 最大争吵：《满江红》与《流浪地球2》的冠军之争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="316">00:05:16</a> 莫名上价值：谁更能代表中国？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">00:08:50</a> 票房冠军《满江红》的争议与真正的问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">00:22:28</a> 《中国乒乓之绝地反击》很可惜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1965">00:32:45</a> &nbsp;观众朋友们！不要自我PUA！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">00:35:07</a> 《流浪地球2》的叙事问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2740">00:45:40</a> &nbsp;当我们在讨论流量演员的演技的时候，我们在讨论什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2920">00:48:40</a> &nbsp;易烊千玺或许不应该接这个角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3689">01:01:29</a> &nbsp;看起来懒洋洋的雷佳音，把劲儿使在哪里了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3890">01:04:50</a> &nbsp;王一博：《无名》演出与《绝望的文盲》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4446">01:14:06</a> &nbsp;张译为什么不配合《狂飙》宣传？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4725">01:18:45</a> &nbsp;张颂文真有那么厉害吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5026">01:23:46</a> &nbsp;《平原上的摩西》最出彩的居然是他？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5196">01:26:36</a> &nbsp;我们的心愿：要讨论，不要吵架</span></p>]]></description>
