  <item>
    <title>ep14.《无限超越班》吐槽①薛凯琪，别什么都想要啦！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63bf2116eab1781ef439bf77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63bf2116eab1781ef439bf77</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Jan 2023 20:50:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>想不到吧，我们又闪现了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如菇时所说，上次我们录制时都还是阴性，现在不但都杨过了，连香港都开关了，真是时光飞逝。这次我们是为了吐槽《无限超越班》而深夜上线，录制了一期，作为还在脑雾中的杨过，真是不容易啊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好滴，废话不多说，上时间轴。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">00:01:16</a> 《无限超越班》上线前，我们对它的想象是？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="185">00:03:05</a> 薛凯琪四十岁这个话题，节目组炒了三期，我们聊了三十多分钟······</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1485">00:24:45</a> 薛凯琪还能回香港歌坛吗？位置很尴尬，已经更新换代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">00:33:00</a> 薛凯琪还能回香港影坛吗？戏路似乎已经被王菀之抢走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2142">00:35:42</a> 我们对薛凯琪的期望，竟然空前一致</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">00:37:47</a> 赵樱子：一个上档次的节目，应该怎样对待一个绝望的五线演员？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">00:40:55</a> 得巴：应该让赵樱子演玉莹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2463">00:41:03</a> 真实的、自洽的、随性的张可颐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2636">00:43:56</a> 沈月：我们该不该同情一个怯场的职业演员？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">00:47:26</a> 观感不太好的范世琦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2906">00:48:26</a> 一个赵雅芝带来的感动位，让我们回到了阿姐们的花旦时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3268">00:54:28</a> 赵雅芝与惠英红：好命女人与苦命女人的美丽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3309">00:55:09</a> 车保罗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3410">00:56:50</a> 节目的整体问题：《演员请就位》和《王牌对王牌》的拼凑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3577">00:59:37</a> 菇时最爱的监制戚其义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3804">01:03:24</a> 路老师：滥煽情真的不适合TVB演员</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3910">01:05:10</a> TVB真的能够整顿内娱吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4330">01:12:10</a> 导师折射出来的TVB演员同质化问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4425">01:13:45</a> 佘诗曼，越演越强</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4605">01:16:45</a> 罗嘉良，再也穿不上的西装</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4750">01:19:10</a> 节目组选的片目······我们真的不太懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4870">01:21:10</a> 说粤语还是国语，这是一个根本就没想清楚甚至可能根本就没想过的问题。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvJVw3Z2jqww7os1qII3eU7m5Bz7.m4a" length="170091028" type="audio/mp4"/>
