    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>ep.13 笑の吐槽③《妈妈的味道》为什么让人反感？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/636e87cc165a4944db497978</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">636e87cc165a4944db497978</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Nov 2022 17:35:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>懒得分两次发啦，就合并为一集啦。存货发完！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>（由于我们是线上聊的，所以音质很渣， 再次抱歉。）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:00:28</a> </span></strong><span>李雪琴</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">00:11:11</a> </span></strong><span>得巴不为人知的另一个名字</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="814">00:13:34</a> 杨笠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">00:22:08</a> 颜怡颜悦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">00:27:40</a> 脱口秀必须好笑吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1736">00:28:56</a> 张踩铃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">00:30:40</a> 刘波与龙傲天</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1955">00:32:35</a> 胖达人棒棒的《进化论》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2197">00:36:37</a> 蒋龙张弛：能够团结最大公约数的逐梦亚军</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2858">00:47:38</a>《妈妈的味道》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">00:52:00</a> 为什么《妈妈的味道》这么让人反感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3776">01:02:56</a> 酷酷的天放，飞扯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3930">01:05:30</a> 杨波</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4016">01:06:56</a>《屋顶》，磕不动，看不懂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4228">01:10:28</a> 李逗逗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4296">01:11:36</a> 难笑到自我怀疑：是我不懂艺术？是我不快乐？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4830">01:20:30</a> 这一季是不是有点功利？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5030">01:23:50</a> 给两季打分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5258">01:27:38</a> 俗套结尾：说说我们在干嘛。</span></p>]]></description>
